<title>USA: Parlux Fragrances doubles credit line.</title>
<headline>Parlux Fragrances doubles credit line.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parlux Fragrances Inc said Monday it has concluded an agreement with  Finova Capital Corp doubling the company's line of credit to $10 million from $5 million.</p>
<p>The $5 million increase is being funded by Merrill Lynch's business financial services unit through a participation agreement, the company said.</p>
<p>The addition to the line of credit will bear interest at prime plus 1/2 percent.</p>
</text>
